ember to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 33 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 50% of normal in August to September and 134% in January to February. So far in 2026, April to May sits at 70% and January to February at 71% on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 1988, with grid 22095 at 70%.</p>"}
